"只影响装得下的句子。\n\n固定：短句也占满设定宽度，右边留白，菜单栏上的位置不会变。\n\n自适应（不建议）：短句按自己的宽度占位，省下多余空间——代价是每换一句都要重建菜单栏这一项。系统只在项出生那一刻给邻居排位，重建太密时邻居图标会停在旧位置（错位、闪动），左键面板也可能被挤掉。想稳定就用固定。" = "Only affects lines that already fit.\n\nFixed: short lines still fill the width you set, leaving space on the right, so the item never moves.\n\nAdaptive (not recommended): short lines take only the width they need — the cost is that the menu bar item is rebuilt on every line change. The system only lays out neighboring items at the moment this one is born, so frequent rebuilds leave neighboring icons stranded at their old positions (misaligned, flickering), and the left-click panel can get dismissed. Use Fixed if you want stability.";
